                    in the{{/if}} <span class="font-semibold">{{#if headingHighlight}}{{headingHighlight}}{{else}}Heart
                        of
                        Gurugram{{/if}}</span></h2>
                <a class="btnBlack" href="{{#if ctaLink}}{{ctaLink}}{{else}}/book-a-campus-tour{{/if}}">{{#if
                    ctaText}}{{ctaText}}{{else}}Book a Visit{{/if}}

